かくかくしかじか... つまりはlove song 出来不出来は横に置いて 耽溺を希望
Such and such... in short, a love song. Leaving success or failure aside, I hope for indulgence.

345
00:53:04,880 --> 00:53:13,580
ちょっとhighな熱いloveに うなされてみない？ キホンのキホン 恋の三大cha-cha-cha
Won't you get feverish over a slightly high, passionate love? The basics of basics: love's three major cha-cha-chas.

346
00:53:16,880 --> 00:53:19,080
[Sign: はみだして♡]
[Sign: Step out of bounds♡]

347
