Chance, chase, challenge 用のないメッセージ さりげないタッチ 翻訳すれば すべてが つまりラビュー
Chance, chase, challenge. Pointless messages, casual touches—translate it all, and it all means I love you.

348
00:53:21,580 --> 00:53:23,880
[Sign: 刺激的愛してる]
[Sign: Passionately in love]

349
00:53:25,580 --> 00:53:30,080
頭で考えずに 脊髄反射で応えて No, noだけじゃ 能がないよ
Don't think with your head, respond with spinal reflexes! Just saying "no, no" lacks creativity.

350
00:53:30,280 --> 00:53:35,580
そうよ あとちょっと もう一歩 3・2・1で
That's right, just a little more, one more step. At 3, 2, 1—

351
00:53:35,880 --> 00:53:42,580
Cha, cha, cha-cha-cha やればできる子 素直でよろしい
Cha, cha, cha-cha-cha—a child who can do it when he tries is good when he's honest!

352
