36度ニブい 君にcaution! もうちょい 私にお熱をあげて欲しいのです
36-degree insensitive boy, caution! I want you to turn up the heat on me just a little more.

353
00:53:46,880 --> 00:53:48,580
[Sign: はみだして♡]
[Sign: Step out of bounds♡]

354
