355
00:53:52,080 --> 00:53:55,580
36度ニブい 君にcaution!
36-degree insensitive boy, caution!

356
00:53:55,580 --> 00:54:01,080
「どうせ・だって・でもでも」なんて 3Dを抜け出して 異次元的ステキをいっぱい 感じて
Break out of 3D stuff like "anyway, but, what if"—and feel plenty of otherworldly wonderfulness!

357
00:54:00,080 --> 00:54:08,580
はい、どーぞ ここからは君の番 「違うかも...」なんて構えないで ちょっとくらいの 勘違いがなきゃ
Yes, go ahead, from here on it's your turn. Don't worry with "maybe I'm wrong"—without a little misunderstanding...

358
00:54:08,580 --> 00:54:13,580
恋なんてそう 始まりようがないもの
...love has no way of starting.

359
00:54:13,880 --> 00:54:16,880
[Sign: はみだして♡]
[Sign: Step out of bounds♡]

360
00:54:17,080 --> 00:54:22,080
ちょっとくらいの 勘違いがなきゃ 恋なんてそう 始まりようがないもの
Without a little misunderstanding, love has no way of starting...!

361
00:54:22,580 --> 00:54:28,080
ラップ お誕生日おめでとう！ ありがとう～！
Rap-chan, happy birthday! Thank you so much~!

362
00:54:30,080 --> 00:54:35,080
一緒に クラップ！ はい！はい！はい！はい！
Together, clap! Yes! Yes! Yes! Yes!

363
00:54:37,080 --> 00:54:38,580
[Sign: はみだして♡]
[Sign: Step out of bounds♡]

364
00:54:39,080 --> 00:54:46,580
キホンのキホン 恋の三大cha-cha-cha Chance, chase, challenge 用のないメッセージ さりげないタッチ 翻訳すれば すべてが つまりラビュー
The basics of basics: love's three major cha-cha-chas: Chance, chase, challenge. Pointless messages, casual touches—translate it all, and it all means I love you.

365
00:54:47,080 --> 00:54:52,080
頭で考えずに 脊髄反射で応えて No, noだけじゃ 能がないよ そうよ あとちょっと もう一歩
Don't think with your head, respond with spinal reflexes! Just saying "no, no" lacks creativity. That's right, just a little more, one more step.

366
